+and chip ID `0x002202a0`. Initialization, GTLS, FDT setup, encrypted capture,
+eight-stage enrollment and live verification have been validated on one Dell
+G5 15 5587. Its image stream needs a device-specific 2x2 deinterleave and
+fusion of two repeated 54x88 readings before feature extraction. Support still
+needs testing on more devices and fingers, so the driver refuses full
